title: "ECONOVA-S: A Dual-Core Scientific Economic Intelligence Architecture for Autonomous AI, Data Economy, Finance, and Sustainable Welfare Discovery"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Homayoun"
    given-names: "Saeid"
version: "2.5"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun"
abstract: >-
  ECONOVA-S is a dual-core scientific economic intelligence architecture that separates a stable economic knowledge core from a replaceable technology core. It integrates systems thinking, causal DAGs, FT50/AJG4* evidence, behavioral experimentation, econometric identification, multi-agent hypothesis generation, evolutionary model search, latent-structure reasoning, independent replication, adversarial review, reproducibility, welfare interpretation, and human approval before scientific-discovery claims.
